# Used instead of the root .dockerignore when building Dockerfile.solo
# (BuildKit prefers <Dockerfile>.dockerignore). Keeps the context small and
# secrets out of every layer. The Rust build only needs src/, ui/ (embedded),
# Cargo.*, rust-toolchain.toml and tests/.
.git
.github
target
**/node_modules
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
deploy
docs
plans
launch
design-lab
evals
website
web
plugin
demo
